message: "If you use these datasets, please cite both the article and this record."
title: "Simulated datasets for a microalgae artificial tree in a photovoltaic-hydrogen microgrid"
abstract: >-
  Simulated carbon price series and cultivation environment data supporting an AI-driven
  energy management framework for the carbon-neutral operation of a microalgae artificial
  tree in a photovoltaic-hydrogen microgrid. Comprises a raw daily carbon price series, the
  engineered feature table and the one-step-ahead supervised table derived from it, together
  with hourly and daily simulated cultivation environment records over a 60-day horizon.
type: dataset
